# Layout grammar

Full doc: [`docs/layout-grammar.md`](../../docs/layout-grammar.md)

## Four primitives

| Primitive | Role |
|-----------|------|
| **Block** | Landmark entry — **exactly one per file** |
| **Box** | Inner non-landmark container (`div` only) |
| **Stack** | Vertical flex |
| **Group** | Horizontal flex (or `fieldset`) |

## Hard rules

1. One Block per preset/block file; no nested Block in the same file
2. No raw `<div class="flex…">` when Stack/Group/Box exists
3. Stack ≠ row; Group ≠ column
4. Document shell (`layout/default.latte`) may use raw `<html>` / `<body>`
5. Children = `{capture}` → `children: (string) $…`

Shell recipe (sidebar + sheet): `.project/constructor/shell-composition.md`
